}, {
"at": 17.0, "shot": "yard", "line": "Narrator  ·  Mattan, enslaved in Jesse’s household, has been packing the bread."
}, {
"at": 23.0, "shot": "two_shot", "line": "Jesse  ·  The bundle is ready. Take it before you leave."
